            <div xml:id="d661">

                <pb facs="0919" n="907" xml:id="pg907"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 PW/8–445: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hurley</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-08-08T20:00:00-04:00">August 8, 1945—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1225. Your 1284, Aug. 4. We would regard raising of question at this juncture in
                    Sub-Commission as unfortunate and we desire that you exert every effort as
                    discreetly as possible to prevent it. If nevertheless question is raised in
                    Sub-Commission inform Dept. and instructions in matter will be sent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Byrnes</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
